<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f4ed">
  <title>Parts of the Human Brain</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f4ed;
      --paper: #fffefa;
      --ink: #222729;
      --muted: #626b6b;
      --green: #3f6659;
      --green-light: #e9f0ed;
      --line: #e2ddd1;
      --shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(45, 40, 30, 0.08);
      --font-main: 'Calibri', 'Carlito', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: var(--font-main);
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    header {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 16px;
    }

    .kicker {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--green);
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin: 8px 0 10px;
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1160px;
      margin: 14px auto 44px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(300px, 0.65fr);
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .panel-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .panel h2 {
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .hint {
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .diagram-wrap {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #ede8dd;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 6px 14px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    svg#brainDiagram {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      user-select: none;
    }

    /* Interactive brain region styling */
    .brain-region {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: filter 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
    }

    .brain-region:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.06) contrast(1.03);
    }

    .brain-region:focus {
      outline: none;
    }

    .brain-region:focus-visible .lobe-outline,
    .brain-region.active .lobe-outline {
      stroke: #1c2422;
      stroke-width: 3.4;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(28, 36, 34, 0.35));
    }

    .brain-region.dimmed {
      opacity: 0.72;
    }

    /* Leader lines & labels matching reference illustration */
    .leader-line {
      stroke: #181a1b;
      stroke-width: 2.1;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      fill: none;
      transition: stroke 0.2s ease, stroke-width 0.2s ease;
    }

    .leader-label {
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      font-size: 17.5px;
      font-weight: 500;
      fill: #181a1b;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: font-weight 0.15s ease, fill 0.15s ease;
    }

    .leader-label:hover,
    .leader-label.active {
      font-weight: 700;
      fill: var(--green);
    }

    /* Quick select pills */
    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .part-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      background: #f5f1e8;
      border: 1px solid #dcd5c7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #2c3331;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.16s ease;
    }

    .part-btn:hover {
      background: #ece6d9;
      border-color: #c7beae;
    }

    .part-btn.active {
      background: var(--green);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(63, 102, 89, 0.24);
    }

    .part-btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--green);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .swatch {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Right side details panel */
    .details {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 460px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 20px;
    }

    .details .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    #partName {
      font-family: var(--font-main);
      font-size: 2.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 10px 0 14px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .details h3 {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--green);
      margin: 18px 0 6px;
    }

    .details p {
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #454f4d;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee9de;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: #7d8681;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      main {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }
      .details {
        position: static;
        min-height: auto;
      }
      header {
        padding: 24px 16px 12px;
      }
      .panel {
        padding: 16px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .leader-label {
        font-size: 15px;
      }
      .part-btn {
        flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 8px);
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="kicker">Interactive Neuroanatomy Guide</div>
    <h1>Parts of the Human Brain</h1>
    <p>Select any sculpted region of the brain or use the buttons below to inspect its anatomical definition and primary functions.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Interactive Brain Illustration Card -->
    <section class="panel" aria-label="Brain Diagram Explorer">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <h2>Explore the brain</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">Click or tap on a colored lobe, the cerebellum, or the spinal cord.</p>

      <div class="diagram-wrap">
        <svg id="brainDiagram" viewBox="0 0 800 500" role="group" aria-label="Sculpted lateral illustration of the human brain">
          <defs>
            <!-- Drop shadow beneath entire brain -->
            <filter id="brainDropShadow" x="-10%" y="-10%" width="125%" height="130%">
